rough a tense garden confrontation, cutting just as Alexander steps in to challenge the thugs.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"candidate_id\": \"W008-C004\",\n      \"posting_rationale\": \"Concludes the lineup with a formal courtroom-style exposure of treason, leaving the fleeing conspirator trapped by a waiting constable.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
